hristian/Aryan Nations of Missouri&lt;br /&gt;http://whitenationalist.org/forum</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1518536671827094841/comments/default/3642352898018748152'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1518536671827094841/comments/default/3642352898018748152'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/03/grand-distractions.html?showComment=1269412672836#c3642352898018748152' title=''/><author><name>Pastor Martin Luther Dzerzhinsky Lindstedt</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04050943359998853460</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/03/grand-distractions.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1518536671827094841' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1518536671827094841' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1897246605"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 24, 2010 at 12:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-791518270987850632</id><published>2010-03-10T22:39:48.651-07:00</published><updated>2010-03-10T22:39:48.651-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Perhaps if the good people of John Day were inform...</title><content type='html'>Perhaps if the good people of John Day were informed of the fact that likely 3 out of every 4 of these &amp;#39;Nazi&amp;#39;s&amp;#39; are really Federal Agents, they would not be frightened of their arrival.&lt;br /&gt;Or, maybe they do know it, and THAT&amp;#39;S what really frightens them.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/15