32.035-07:00</published><updated>2010-03-05T11:46:32.035-07:00</updated><title type='text'>This one really hits home Mr. Grigg. Here in our t...</title><content type='html'>This one really hits home Mr. Grigg. Here in our tiny community of Bishop Ca. we have our very own BLM eco-power tripper. Her soul mission in life is to completely shut down all mining operations in the Owens Valley by hook or by crook. She even makes up her own laws as she goes and we can&amp;#39;t even get her superior to rein her in. My husband, being a mining geologist, has been in constant head-butting mode with this self-appointed eco-ranger for almost 7 years. Neo-Nazis? If only that was our greatest worry.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1518536671827094841/comments/default/2317531174183014998'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1518536671827094841/comments/default/2317531174183014998'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/03/grand-distractions.html?showComment=1267814792035#c2317531174183014998' title=''/><author><name>Saladin</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09930510353343780782</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='27' src='http://bp1.blogger.com/_3nm82BZKt8w/SGV-ZNce_fI/AAAAAAAAABE/ea2m8hZnrRw/S220/Help+child.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/03/grand-distractions.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1518536671827094841' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1518536671827094841' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-376846434"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="March 5, 2010 at 11:46 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.p